{"kind":"finding","id":"F-recording-tree-025-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/RecordingFinalizationCacheProducerTests.cs","line":80,"method":"HasMeaningfulThrust_UsesActiveEngineAndRcsThrottle","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RecordingFinalizationCacheProducer.cs:634; replace the RCS HasMeaningfulThrottle call with `return false` -> red; deleting the engine call at :631 -> stays green, so the engine half of the name is unwitnessed","what_it_asserts":"HasMeaningfulThrust(engineKeys={1}, engineThrottle={1:0.0}, rcsKeys={2}, rcsThrottle={2:0.25}) is true.","why_weak":"The engine arm evaluates to false on this fixture (throttle 0.0 is below the 0.01 threshold), so the asserted true is decided solely by the RCS arm. An engine-thrust detection regression, or deleting the engine call, ships green; no engine-only positive and no all-zero negative cell exists anywhere in the suite.","proposed_action":"Add engine-only cases: {1} with throttle 0.5 -> true, and {1} with throttle 0.0 (RCS sets empty) -> false, so both arms of HasMeaningfulThrust are discriminated.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"RecordingFinalizationCacheProducer","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/RecordingFinalizationCacheProducer.cs","sut_line":71,"case_kind":"negative","proposed_name":"ShouldRefresh_NonFiniteCurrentUt_DoesNotRefresh","sketch":"ShouldRefresh(100.0, double.NaN, 5.0, force:false, previousDigest:\"d\", currentDigest:\"d\", requiresPeriodicRefresh:true) -> false; repeat with double.PositiveInfinity as currentUT.","guards":"the !IsFinite(currentUT) guard at :71-72, which the four committed ShouldRefresh cells never reach (all pass finite UTs); a NaN/Inf clock would otherwise force a refresh every tick","risk":"recording"}
{"kind":"coverage","sut":"RecordingFinalizationCacheProducer","sut_file":"Source/Parsek/RecordingFinalizationCacheProducer.cs","sut_line":73,"case_kind":"boundary","proposed_name":"ShouldRefresh_LastRefreshUnset_RefreshesOnFirstCall","sketch":"ShouldRefresh(double.MinValue, 100.0, 5.0, false, \"same\", \"same\", requiresPeriodicRefresh:false) -> true; repeat with double.NaN lastRefreshUT -> true.","guards":"the first-refresh seed at :73 (!IsFinite(lastRefreshUT) || lastRefreshUT == double.MinValue), bypassed by every committed cell since they all pass lastRefreshUT=100.0","risk":"recording"}
